'''Platja d'Aro Airport''' ({{lang|ca|Aeroport de Platja d'Aro}}; [[IATA airport code|IATA]]: PDA, [[ICAO airport code|ICAO]]: PDIB) is a domestic airport serving [[Platja d'Aro]], a tourism destination on a peninsula in [[Migjorn Province]], [[Balboa]]. The airport serves the surrounding beach resorts and coastal tourism sector. It is served by [[Aeroístmus]], which operates essential services from [[Cecilio Ríos International Airport|Sant Bart]].

